==English==
{{wikipedia|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|masculine|ism}}, as opposed to {{m|en|feminism}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# An ideology of [[masculinity]] or of male rights; ''especially'' an ideology opposed to [[feminism]].
